{"schemaVersion":1,"moduleId":"M2-04","example":{"title":"路口行向管制","intro":"讓可行與禁止的方向容易辨認，並與駕駛實際行車動線一致。","items":[{"id":"consistency","title":"遵行與禁行資訊選用一致","text":"依管制目的選擇遵行方向或禁止轉向標誌，避免不同方式混用造成誤判。"},{"id":"placement","title":"標誌位置配合辨識與決策","text":"檢查近端、遠端及車道指向線的搭配，讓駕駛有足夠時間理解行向規則。"},{"id":"entry","title":"處理分隔島與單行道出口","text":"在島頭、分道處與單行道出口整合方向、禁入及警告資訊，避免逆向誤入。"}],"moduleId":"M2-04","pageId":"results-module-m2-04","images":[{"key":"results:module-m2-04-current-1","role":"current","label":"現況問題 1","rotation":0},{"key":"results:module-m2-04-current-2","role":"current","label":"現況問題 2","rotation":0},{"key":"results:module-m2-04-diagram","role":"module","label":"模組圖","rotation":0}],"source":{"file":"chapters/03-modules/07-intersection-movement-control.typ","sha256":"c55e348f490ee8c80f64449df5691a28e72847d16395d9ad40864839d8976019","title":"路口行向管制","moduleId":"M2-04","section":"現況與議題、圖例說明及延伸應用","issuePageId":"m204-movement-issues","diagramPageId":"m204-movement-diagram","representative":"materials/03-modules/M2-04/M2-04_行駛動線遵行與限制代表型1.svg"}},"assets":{"results:module-m2-04-current-1":{"file":"materials/03-modules/M2-04/M2-04.1_現況議題_01.png","width":1241,"height":748,"moduleId":"M2-04","role":"current","label":"M2-04 現況問題 1","sha256":"6be106c197b93d46b1a7686606f69ed36f82bd547a78c6d1c190041f94ba94f1"},"results:module-m2-04-current-2":{"file":"materials/03-modules/M2-04/M2-04.1_現況議題_02.png","width":599,"height":447,"moduleId":"M2-04","role":"current","label":"M2-04 現況問題 2","sha256":"da6ff50471e00a97a02f45abd86cdea7a7558fe496ca776486ca6f2ef0768a77"},"results:module-m2-04-diagram":{"file":"materials/03-modules/M2-04/M2-04_行駛動線遵行與限制代表型1.svg","width":422,"height":365,"moduleId":"M2-04","role":"module","label":"M2-04 模組圖","sha256":"58da630639d24544510d3d4655ec0a861f3f02dab70c743ec55b0b45300e64ff"}}}
